    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25553" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπληκτ-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>skirmish with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππεῦσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>wrangle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοῖς γυναίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς γύναιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.760a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				2.29
			</span></i>: c. dat. modi, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοῖς σκώμμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			:—late in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Horap.
				1.70
			</span></i>.</div>
